Z||000002||jelly2m8||08-06-2001||10:40 PM||||Check out the Fiero Owners Online Chat Room.<BR>We are open 24/7. There is always someone in there, although most are away through the days. Check in in the evenings.<BR>Heres a URL with info on how to join in the chat room. It is IRC based, but there is now a java client for your browser.So you can join either way. If you use the java thingy, have patience, as it goes through a server on dial up. <A HREF="http://www.fierodrivers.com/chat/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierodrivers.com/chat/index.html</A> ||||reg||1
